Description: A sleek, customizable desktop shell crafted for Wayland.
 Noctalia is a full desktop shell for Wayland compositors. It provides
 bars, dock, launcher, notifications, control center, wallpaper, lock
 screen, and theming. It is not a compositor or display manager.
 .
 Built for Ubuntu 24.04 (Noble): WirePlumber 0.4, sdbus-c++ 1.4, and a
 vendored stb_image_resize2.h. D-Bus services (notifications, tray,
 MPRIS, agents) remain enabled via the sdbus-c++ 1.4 registration API.
